## Show a live activity log on entity Data Quality Checks
================================================================================

Context: Explorer still showed only "Running data quality checks…" with a
spinner. That popup waited on a single GET /dtwin/nodes/shacl, so the
Knowledge Graph tab log could not appear. Start the entity check as a
TaskManager job, poll log_entries into a scrollable well, and keep the
synchronous GET for MCP and the public API.

