## Teach Auto-Map to emit Unity Catalog metric-view SQL
================================================================================

Context: Mapping → Auto-Map already received metric views from get_metadata
(object_kind + column roles) but the agent prompt never mentioned MEASURE()
or GROUP BY, so the LLM treated them as tables. Align Auto-Map with the PGE
generator: prompt rules plus a submit-time check_metric_view_sql guard.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_auto_assignment/engine.py
   METRIC VIEW SOURCES rule: dimensions, MEASURE(measure), GROUP BY; ID is a dimension.
2. src/agents/tools/mapping.py
   Reject SELECT * / unwrapped measures / missing GROUP BY when the SQL hits a metric view.
3. tests/eval/datasets/agent_auto_assignment/metric_view.jsonl
   10-row contract dataset (happy / ambiguous / adversarial).
4. tests/eval/run_agent_auto_assignment_metric.py
   Dry-run judge (aggregate 1.000 vs threshold 0.95).
