## Simulation menu (what-if sandbox) — v1
================================================================================

Context: New 5th workspace "Simulation" (after Domain, Ontology, Mapping,
Knowledge Graph). Users assert hypothetical facts on a sandbox copy of a graph
slice (entity neighbourhood, cohort, or class population capped at 5000),
re-run reasoning there, and compare before/after. The live knowledge graph is
never written. Lakebase backend only; graphless domains are redirected.

